ion votes.xui.recovery.authority-step¢dargs†dtextxC5. Revalidate clock authority. No preliminary clock change is made.xui.rust.quit-partial-title¢dargs†dtextx#Part of the service pair is runningxui.rust.quit-pending-title¢dargs†dtextxService state is changingxui.rust.quit-running-title¢dargs†dtextx Background services keep runningxui.rust.quit-stopped-title¢dargs†dtextxServices are currently stoppedxui.rust.quit-unknown-title¢dargs†dtextxService state is unconfirmedxui.rust.source-review-only¢dargs†dtextx0Review local changes only. Apply is unavailable.xui.shell.time-policy-power¢dargs†dtextxOpen time policy in Power Userxui.status.headline.blocked¢dargs†dtextxSynchronization needs attentionxui.status.headline.expired¢dargs†dtextxNo usable current time estimatexui.status.headline.unknown¢dargs†dtextsStatus not observedxui.diagnostic.export-reason¢dargs†dtextxïCopy and file export are unavailable until a bounded redacted report and an ordinary-user output adapter are connected. There is no automatic upload.xui.error.edit-before-select¢dargs†dtextxCFinish or cancel the current sample edit before selecting a source.xui.fixture.difference-label¢dargs†dtextxEstimated clock differencexui.fixture.fixture-snapshot¢dargs†dtextx"Local fixture ¬∑ no service statusxui.fixture.repository-error¢dargs†dtextxPThe browser could not be opened. You can use the repository address shown above.xui.fixture.repository-label¢dargs†dtextqSource repositoryxui.fixture.schedule-heading¢dargs†dtextoSynchronizationxui.fixture.source-list-note¢dargs†dtextx_One logical identity per row. Aliases and additional addresses do not create independent votes.xui.fixture.status-qualifier¢dargs†dtextxGAuthentication, source agreement and clock accuracy are separate facts.xui.fixture.sync-unavailable¢dargs†dtextxMUnavailable in this fixture. No measurement or clock change can be requested.xui.fixture.uncertainty-note¢dargs†dtextx4A model estimate would not guarantee clock accuracy.xui.inspection.close-details¢dargs†dtextmClose detailsxui.inspection.editor-active¢dargs†dtextxMFinish or cancel the source preview edit before searching or opening details.xui.inspection.hidden-source¢dargs†dtextxYThis source is hidden by the current search. Clear the search or choose a visible source.xui.inspection.invalid-query¢dargs†dtextxSUse up to 253 printable ASCII search characters. An empty search shows all sources.xui.inspection.last-accepted¢dargs†dtextxLast accepted measurementxui.inspection.local-id-note¢dargs†dtextxJThe session editor identity is not a production independent-vote identity.xui.inspection.not-evaluated¢dargs†dtextmNot evaluatedxui.inspection.page-required¢dargs†dtextxEOpen Sources in Power User mode to search or inspect source previews.xui.inspection.vote-identity¢dargs†dtextxIndependent-vote identityxui.policy.apply-unavailable¢dargs†dtextxOProfile activation is unavailable: no protected Apply transaction is connected.xui.preferences.custom-label¢dargs†dtextsInterval in minutesxui.preferences.sign-in-help¢dargs†dtextx\Available while the tray preference is on. This is separate from background service startup.xui.recovery.roughtime-title¢dargs†dtextuRoughtime when neededxui.rust.exit-restore-failed¢dargs†dtextxThe app exit request failed and the window could not be restored. Window state is unconfirmed; no service change was requested.xui.rust.helper-preview-edit¢dargs†dtextx*Editing the retained local helper preview.xui.rust.service-unavailable¢dargs†dtextxÉService management is unavailable in this preview. No request was submitted; runtime, startup and clock ownership were not changed.xui.rust.source-id-exhausted¢dargs†dtextx1Restart the preview before adding another source.xui.shell.background-service¢dargs†dtextrBackground servicexui.shell.time-manager-title¢dargs†dtextoTime managementxui.source.apply-unavailable¢dargs†dtextxZApply is unavailable in this fixture. Review and editing affect only this preview session.xui.source.empty-description¢dargs†dtextxlAdd a source preview or undo a removal. The original fixture and active service configuration are unchanged.xui.status.headline.conflict¢dargs†dtextuTime sources disagreexui.status.headline.holdover¢dargs†dtextx.No fresh time check - using the previous modelxui.status.headline.tracking¢dargs†dtextpTime sync activexui.diagnostic.invalid-choice¢dargs†dtextx/Choose one of the available diagnostic options.xui.feedback.source-cancelled¢dargs†dtextx$Unaccepted editor changes discarded.xui.fixture.about-description¢dargs†dtextxêNevroTick is a Windows timekeeping project designed for clear clock status and secure synchronization using NTP and Network Time Security (NTS).xui.fixture.freshness-heading¢dargs†dtextrEvidence freshnessxui.fixture.uncertainty-label¢dargs†dtextuEstimated uncertaintyxui.inspection.accepted-query¢dargs†dtextoAccepted searchxui.inspection.authentication¢dargs†dtextuPacket authenticationxui.inspection.hidden-details¢dargs†dtextx]This retained source is hidden by the current search. Clear the search to show its row again.xui.inspection.invalid-filter¢dargs†dtextxChoose a listed source filter.xui.inspection.not-applicable¢dargs†dtextnNot applicablexui.inspection.request-status¢dargs†dtextvCurrent request statusxui.preferences.language-help¢dargs†dtextxYOnly English is available. Additional catalogs require validation and independent review.xui.preferences.observer-help¢dargs†dtextxjNew local alerts need an active NevroTick window or tray observer. Background timekeeping runs separately.xui.preferences.sign-in-label¢dargs†dtextx&Start NevroTick in the tray at sign-inxui.recovery.count-option.off¢dargs†dtextcOffxui.recovery.count-option.one¢dargs†dtextjOne helperxui.recovery.count-option.two¢dargs†dtextkTwo helpersxui.rust.close-restore-failed¢dargs†dtextxtApp close failed and the window could not be restored. Window state is unconfirmed; no service change was requested.xui.rust.helper-raw-discarded¢dargs†dtextxCUnsubmitted helper edits discarded. The local preview is unchanged.xui.rust.observer-unconfirmed¢dargs†dtextx=A running NevroTick window or tray observer is not confirmed.xui.rust.quit-review-required¢dargs†dtextx;Open Quit UI and review its warning before confirming exit.xui.shell.separate-management¢dargs†dtextxÄManaging a service opens its settings. Stopping, disabling or changing time management requires a separate authorized operation.xui.shell.service-description¢dargs†dtextxtReview background synchronization separately from this app window. Service controls are unavailable in this fixture.xui.shell.service-unavailable¢dargs†dtextxmNo service-management adapter is connected. These controls cannot submit a service or Windows Time operation.xui.shell.unknown-consequence¢dargs†dtextxpQuitting closes only the app observer. It does not stop services or confirm whether they are running or stopped.xui.source.review-description¢dargs†dtextx_Review the original fixture and the local candidate. No changes have been applied to a service.xui.status.detail.unavailable¢dargs†dtextxöCurrent synchronization is unconfirmed. A missing status connection does not establish that services stopped. Inspect diagnostics for the available facts.xui.status.headline.acquiring¢dargs†dtextuChecking time sourcesxui.diagnostic.collection-note¢dargs†dtextx§Choose an illustrative scope and duration. These choices stay in this window and do not change logging or collect data. Example durations are not production limits.xui.diagnostic.collection-open¢dargs†dtextx$Temporary troubleshooting collectionxui.diagnostic.correction-note¢dargs†dtextxäDirection, magnitude, reference interval, evidence age and proposal validity are unavailable. No clock change or authorization is implied.xui.diagnostic.correction-open¢dargs†dtextx$Review clock-correction availabilityxui.diagnostic.correction-rule¢dargs†dtextx‚A real proposal must be bound to fresh authenticated evidence, agreement, current policy and clock generation. An expired or changed proposal cannot be approved. Moving the clock can affect timestamps and running applications.xui.diagnostic.effective-scope¢dargs†dtexttEffective collectionxui.diagnostic.required-events¢dargs†dtextxåRequired security and service events remain independent of optional verbosity. Closing this view does not stop an active collection session.xui.diagnostic.scope-option.ui¢dargs†dtextgUI onlyxui.fixture.code-license-label¢dargs†dtextkSource codexui.fixture.diagnostics-events¢dargs†dtextmEvent historyxui.fixture.editor-description¢dargs†dtextxZEdit a local source entry. It will not join an active source set or change service policy.xui.fixture.editor-unavailable¢dargs†dtextx8Update is unavailable in this standalone source preview.xui.fixture.no-live-connection¢dargs†dtextrNo live connectionxui.fixture.statistics-heading¢dargs†dtextqTime measurementsxui.inspection.details-heading¢dargs†dtextvSource preview detailsxui.inspection.not-established¢dargs†dtextoNot establishedxui.inspection.selected-hidden¢dargs†dtextxoThe selected editor source is hidden by the search. Choose a visible row or clear the search before editing it.xui.inspection.unauthenticated¢dargs†dtextxUnauthenticated protocolxui.policy.observe-consequence¢dargs†dtextxÑObserve only authorizes no product clock writes. It does not turn on Windows Time or settle the acquisition and authentication mode.xui.preferences.language-label¢dargs†dtextrInterface languagexui.preferences.observer-label¢dargs†dtextuNotification observerxui.recovery.apply-unavailable¢dargs†dtextxvApplying helper settings requires the installed application's authorized management interface, which is not connected.xui.recovery.leave-description¢dargs†dtextxêKeep the raw fields for later, discard unsubmitted edits, or stay here. The retained local preview, active policy and services remain unchanged.xui.rust.notifications-blocked¢dargs†dtextx<Windows settings or organization policy block notifications.xui.shell.observer-consequence¢dargs†dtextxwNew local notifications stop when the last NevroTick window or tray observer exits. Background timekeeping is separate.xui.shell.personal-preferences¢dargs†dtextpYour preferencesxui.source.protocol-option.ntp¢dargs†dtextuNTP (unauthenticated)xui.source.protocol-option.nts¢dargs†dtextxNTS (authenticated responses)xui.status.detail.rate-limited¢dargs†dtextxyThe reported request limit remains in force. Reopening this window does not reset it; no retry duration is invented here.xui.status.evidence.historical¢dargs†dtextx4Historical evidence only - current state unconfirmedxui.status.headline.leap-guard¢dargs†dtextx"Rechecking around a UTC transitionxui.diagnostic.collection-state¢dargs†dtextkNot startedxui.diagnostic.collection-title¢dargs†dtextxTemporary diagnostic collectionxui.diagnostic.correction-empty¢dargs†dtextx(No correction proposal has been receivedxui.diagnostic.correction-title¢dargs†dtextwClock-correction reviewxui.feedback.interval-cancelled¢dargs†dtextxInterval draft discarded.xui.feedback.preference-updated¢dargs†dtextx&Updated for this preview session only.xui.fixture.artwork-description¢dargs†dtextxòCopyright David Osipov. NevroTick artwork and visual brand: all rights reserved. Visual assets are licensed separately from the application source code.xui.fixture.authentication-note¢dargs†dtextxONTS authenticates server responses; it does not guarantee their clock accuracy.xui.fixture.diagnostics-heading¢dargs†dtextkDiagnosticsxui.fixture.privacy-description¢dargs†dtextxÆThis preview collects no diagnostics or telemetry. Opening the repository uses your default browser. The planned application specifies no automatic telemetry or crash upload.xui.fixture.service-description¢dargs†dtextxjRuntime, startup configuration, clock ownership and verified synchronization remain separate observations.xui.fixture.sources-description¢dargs†dtextx;Identity, authentication and agreement are separate checks.xui.fixture.text-contract-label¢dargs†dtextmText contractxui.inspection.auth-measurement¢dargs†dtextxLast authenticated measurementxui.native-observer.stop-failed¢dargs†dtextxaNative observer cleanup could not be confirmed. The app stays open; no service state was changed.xui.preferences.scheduling-note¢dargs†dtextxfRecovery, backoff and server limits may delay the next check. Automatic is recommended for normal use.xui.preferences.tray-ready-note¢dargs†dtextx•The tray icon is available. Closing this window keeps the app observer running; Quit UI still closes only the app. Windows sign-in registration is still unavailable.xui.recovery.one-helper-warning¢dargs†dtextx8One helper provides a weaker, unauthenticated date hint.xui.recovery.two-helper-warning¢dargs†dtextxvBoth helpers must reply and agree; there is no silent fallback to one. Agreement still does not authenticate the date.xui.rust.recovery-edit-required¢dargs†dtextx2Choose Keep editing before changing helper fields.xui.rust.recovery-page-required¢dargs†dtextx5Open Date recovery before editing its helper preview.xui.rust.source-preview-updated¢dargs†dtextx[Preview updated in memory only. The active fixture and service configuration are unchanged.xui.status.detail.date-recovery¢dargs†dtextxïProvisional date recovery does not change Windows time or establish authenticated tracking. Full verification and fresh agreement are still required.xui.status.headline.reacquiring¢dargs†dtextxRechecking after a changexui.diagnostic.collection-reason¢dargs†dtextx The collection adapter is not connected. UI collection needs no elevation; service collection requires separate administrator authorization. Combined collection must report each component independently.xui.error.invalid-custom-minutes¢dargs†dtextxcEnter whole minutes of at least 1, using digits only. For a very large value, try a smaller number.xui.fixture.authentication-label¢dargs†dtextnAuthenticationxui.fixture.authentication-value¢dargs†dtextoNot establishedxui.fixture.positive-offset-note¢dargs†dtextxqA positive offset would mean Windows is behind the reference. Estimated uncertainty would not guarantee accuracy.xui.fixture.settings-description¢dargs†dtextxPReview the intended settings. Protected actions are unavailable in this preview.xui.fixture.technologies-heading¢dargs†dtextxTechnologies and librariesxui.inspection.query-placeholder¢dargs†dtextxSource name or server identityxui.inspection.roles-unavailable¢dargs†dtextxÜUsed and Other filters need selection evidence, which is unavailable. Selecting a row for editing does not make it Main or Supporting.xui.native-observer.stop-timeout¢dargs†dtextx[Native observer cleanup is still pending. The app stays open; no service state was changed.xui.preferences.host-unavailable¢dargs†dtextxPPreference editing is unavailable until the checked Rust presenter is connected.xui.recovery.context-description¢dargs†dtextxnDate-recovery helpers are separate from ordinary synchronization sources and supply no normal-selection votes.xui.recovery.helpers-description¢dargs†dtextx·Off by default. These optional, unauthenticated helpers supply only a certificate-date hint. They are separate from signed Roughtime, never an automatic fallback, and do not authenticate time or vote in normal time selection.xui.rust.helper-preview-retained¢dargs†dtextxQHelper preview retained in memory only. Active policy and services are unchanged.xui.rust.recovery-leave-required¢dargs†dtextx<Choose Keep draft, Discard edits, or Stay before continuing.xui.rust.tray-preference-updated¢dargs†dtextx6Tray preference updated for this preview session only.xui.status.headline.initializing¢dargs†dtextx#Starting and checking configurationxui.status.headline.observe-only¢dargs†dtextx'Clock changes by NevroTick are disabledxui.status.headline.rate-limited¢dargs†dtextx!Time checks are currently limitedx ui.diagnostic.unavailable-action¢dargs†dtextxnThis operation is unavailable. No collection, clipboard, file, administrator or clock operation was performed.x ui.fixture.synchronization-label¢dargs†dtextxVerified synchronizationx ui.fixture.synchronization-value¢dargs†dtextoNot establishedx ui.inspection.no-matches-heading¢dargs†dtextxNo matching source previewsx ui.native-notification.test-body¢dargs†dtextx;This is an example. No clock or service status was checked.x ui.preferences.accepted-interval¢dargs†dtextxAccepted in this previewx ui.preferences.availability-help¢dargs†dtextxsThe app preference does not grant Windows permission. Windows and organization settings can suppress notifications.x ui.preferences.incidents-heading¢dargs†dtextxRecent notification problemsx ui.preferences.test-notification¢dargs†dtextvSend test notificationx ui.recovery.settings-description¢dargs†dtextxëSigned-date recovery details and optional, off-default plain-NTP helper previews open in Power user. Back returns to this Settings view and mode.x ui.rust.helper-preview-discarded¢dargs†dtextxCHelper preview discarded. Active policy and services are unchanged.x ui.rust.quit-partial-consequence¢dargs†dtextxnThe service pair is not fully stopped. Quitting closes only the app observer and does not stop either service.x ui.rust.quit-pending-consequence¢dargs†dtextxÜA service transition is not settled. Quitting the app neither completes nor cancels that operation, and does not establish the result.x ui.rust.quit-running-consequence¢dargs†dtextxLQuitting closes only the app observer. Running background services continue.x ui.rust.quit-show-cleanup-failed¢dargs†dtextxuThe quit warning could not be shown and window cleanup failed. Window state is unconfirmed; no UI exit was confirmed.x ui.rust.quit-stopped-consequence¢dargs†dtextx]Quitting closes only the app observer. It does not change service startup or clock ownership.x ui.rust.recovery-review-required¢dargs†dtextx7Review a valid helper preview before using this action.x ui.rust.source-operation-updated¢dargs†dtextx8Source preview updated. The active fixture is unchanged.x ui.shell.time-policy-description¢dargs†dtextxmReview the synchronization profile and date-recovery settings. Local previews do not activate service policy.x ui.source.statistics-description¢dargs†dtextxÄThe local source preview contains identities and protocol-specific ports, without offsets, uncertainties or measurement history.x ui.status.detail.windows-managed¢dargs†dtextxNevroTick does not control the clock in this reported mode. Windows Time ownership does not establish verified synchronization.x ui.status.evidence.authenticated¢dargs†dtextx&Current NTS authentication establishedx ui.status.headline.date-recovery¢dargs†dtextxRecovering a provisional datex!ui.fixture.service-protected-note¢dargs†dtextxéService controls require the installed application's authorized management path. This preview cannot start, stop, restart or disable services.x!ui.fixture.statistics-description¢dargs†dtextxVPer-source observations will appear here when qualified measurement data is available.x!ui.fixture.statistics-empty-title¢dargs†dtextxNo measurements in this previewx!ui.native-notification.test-title¢dargs†dtextxNevroTick test notificationx!ui.preferences.notifications-help¢dargs†dtextxrImportant problems and persistent issues that need attention. Routine checks and planned service stops stay quiet.x!ui.recovery.roughtime-description¢dargs†dtextx–Roughtime supplies a signed approximate date when an incorrect computer date prevents secure NTS checks. Usable retained or strict NTS paths take priority; healthy tracking needs no periodic Roughtime checks.x!ui.shell.synchronization-settings¢dargs†dtextoSynchronizationx!ui.status.action.context-required¢dargs†dtextx/Open Status before using its contextual action.x!ui.status.detail.uncertain-result¢dargs†dtextxqReconcile the actual result and clock ownership before repeating the operation. No outcome or cleanup is assumed.x"ui.diagnostic.scope-option.service¢dargs†dtextlService onlyx"ui.fixture.diagnostics-description¢dargs†dtextxWObserved facts and useful next steps, without collecting or exporting real diagnostics.x"ui.fixture.observation-description¢dargs†dtextxOThis window displays local fixtures. It is not connected to NevroTick services.x"ui.preferences.notifications-label¢dargs†dtextxNotify me about problemsx"ui.preferences.preferences-heading¢dargs†dtextpTray and sign-inx"ui.rust.sign-in-preference-updated¢dargs†dtextx9Sign-in preference updated for this preview session only.x"ui.status.headline.service-stopped¢dargs†dtextxBackground services are stoppedx"ui.status.headline.windows-managed¢dargs†dtextxWindows Time manages the clockx#ui.diagnostic.scope-option.combined¢dargs†dtextnUI and servicex#ui.fixture.technologies-description¢dargs†dtextxÂWritten in Rust. Slint provides the native interface; garde validates input. Serde and serde_json support strict localization source decoding. The separate engine pilot uses Tokio. Timekeeping integration is still in development.x#ui.preferences.observer-unavailable¢dargs†dtextx=A running NevroTick window or tray observer is not confirmed.x#ui.preferences.preferences-boundary¢dargs†dtextxrChanges are process-local preview preferences. They are not saved to Windows or applied to the background service.x#ui.preferences.schedule-description¢dargs†dtextx]How often to request time measurements. This preference does not authorize clock adjustments.x#ui.preferences.unknown-availability¢dargs†dtextx@Windows notification availability is unconfirmed or unavailable.x#ui.preferences.windows-availability¢dargs†dtexttWindows availabilityx#ui.rust.notification-os-unconfirmed¢dargs†dtextx@Windows notification availability is unconfirmed or unavailable.x#ui.status.evidence.current-estimate¢dargs†dtextx-Current qualified estimate - age not suppliedx#ui.status.headline.uncertain-result¢dargs†dtextxThe operation result is unknownx$ui.native-notification.test-accepted¢dargs†dtextxHWindows accepted the test request. A banner or reading is not confirmed.x$ui.preferences.incidents-unavailable¢dargs†dtextx§No incident feed is connected. This view cannot confirm whether problems were reported, resolved or dismissed. Dismissing a notification does not resolve its cause.x$ui.preferences.notifications-heading¢dargs†dtextuWindows notificationsx%ui.feedback.no-notification-submitted¢dargs†dtextx&No Windows notification was submitted.x%ui.native-notification.test-coalesced¢dargs†dtextx>This test will not be submitted again during this app session.x%ui.preferences.interval-option.custom¢dargs†dtextuEnter my own intervalx%ui.status.headline.correction-pending¢dargs†dtextx(A clock correction needs separate reviewx&ui.status.evidence.agreement-satisfied¢dargs†dtextxCurrent agreement policy metx'ui.preferences.tray-adapter-unavailable¢dargs†dtextxThese switches only retain your choices in this preview. A native tray icon and Windows sign-in registration are not connected.x'ui.rust.notification-preference-updated¢dargs†dtextx>Notification preference updated for this preview session only.x(ui.preferences.interval-option.automatic¢dargs†dtextwAutomatic (recommended)x(ui.rust.notifications-native-unavailable¢dargs†dtextxUWindows notifications are unavailable in this fixture. No notification was submitted.x)ui.native-notification.test-indeterminate¢dargs†dtextxNThe test request outcome is unconfirmed. A banner or reading is not confirmed.x)ui.shell.personal-preferences-description¢dargs†dtextxhChoose how this app starts and stays available. These choices do not start or stop a background service.x+ui.preferences.notification-windows-allowed¢dargs†dtextx%Windows permits notification requestsx+ui.preferences.notification-windows-blocked¢dargs†dtextx<Windows settings or organization policy block notifications.x,ui.preferences.notification-observer-running¢dargs†dtextxNevroTick observer is runningx,ui.preferences.notification-test-unavailable¢dargs†dtextxeA test needs a connected native adapter, current Windows permission and a running NevroTick observer.nplural_profilewenglish-u64-cardinal-v1nschema_versionpcatalog_revisionrsource_fingerprintx@34c97f8a74a9559ae998f55389bedd9f92bb3f878e72df84d090372053a69e80utext_contract_version